    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/94ada5ca70b800c72c35f68712505223.avif?t=1753701606\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The internet's favorite warehouse has been obsessively recreated in <strong>1-to-1 real world accuracy</strong>! Everything is interactable in this sandbox exploration game. Find and use tons of items (including <strong>the best VHS camera mode ever made</strong>), unlock the doors, and explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/013c091c63175a13242b6f3e451e12c3.poster.avif?t=1753701606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/013c091c63175a13242b6f3e451e12c3.webm?t=1753701606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destruction, physics, &amp; lasers!</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of interactable physics items can be picked up, thrown, and destroyed. Drop the ball, spin the wheel, collect the tapes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/080c8b523d22ffa53c736b70c09927a0.poster.avif?t=1753701606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/080c8b523d22ffa53c736b70c09927a0.webm?t=1753701606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clock in &amp; answer the call!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The modern VCR repair shop features ultramodern personal computing as well as classic landline communications. Prospective employees will demonstrate competancy in both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/b1df5519859fe1468bdc968173689376.poster.avif?t=1753701606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/b1df5519859fe1468bdc968173689376.webm?t=1753701606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hear the inaudible &amp; see the invisible!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tools may let you percieve parts of the world that are hidden to others...if you're paying attention.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/94ada5ca70b800c72c35f68712505223.avif?t=1753701606\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The internet's favorite warehouse has been obsessively recreated in <strong>1-to-1 real world accuracy</strong>! Everything is interactable in this sandbox exploration game. Find and use tons of items (including <strong>the best VHS camera mode ever made</strong>), unlock the doors, and explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/013c091c63175a13242b6f3e451e12c3.poster.avif?t=1753701606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/013c091c63175a13242b6f3e451e12c3.webm?t=1753701606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destruction, physics, &amp; lasers!</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of interactable physics items can be picked up, thrown, and destroyed. Drop the ball, spin the wheel, collect the tapes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/080c8b523d22ffa53c736b70c09927a0.poster.avif?t=1753701606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/080c8b523d22ffa53c736b70c09927a0.webm?t=1753701606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clock in &amp; answer the call!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The modern VCR repair shop features ultramodern personal computing as well as classic landline communications. Prospective employees will demonstrate competancy in both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/b1df5519859fe1468bdc968173689376.poster.avif?t=1753701606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344680/extras/b1df5519859fe1468bdc968173689376.webm?t=1753701606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hear the inaudible &amp; see the invisible!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tools may let you percieve parts of the world that are hidden to others...if you're paying attention.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore the world's most famous bad movie warehouse! Collect tapes, spin the wheel, and drop the ball in this amazingly accurate and atmospheric first person sandbox.",
